    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risky Rocket is a 3D Rocket Jumping platformer. Hone your skills and launch through the climb map and many time trial levels. Using the physics of momentum, and propulsion of rockets to build up speed and become a master of Rocket Jumping.<strong></strong><br><br>  <br><strong>Climb to the top</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend the skies using nothing but your feet and rocket launcher! Can you reach top? Be careful.. one wrong move may send you back down to the beginning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/17645b636744321ff8596d38da9fc0ed.poster.avif?t=1753051866\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/17645b636744321ff8596d38da9fc0ed.webm?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/17645b636744321ff8596d38da9fc0ed.mp4?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against players around the world in the Time Trial levels with online leaderboards. Maximize your speed-running abilities and achieve all the gold medal times! Perhaps there's something more lucrative than Gold..\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/44885620b58704c1edc1d5c25a454839.poster.avif?t=1753051866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/44885620b58704c1edc1d5c25a454839.webm?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/44885620b58704c1edc1d5c25a454839.mp4?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/3398f4e020a070e61b4ba8f7865ba127.poster.avif?t=1753051866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/3398f4e020a070e61b4ba8f7865ba127.webm?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/3398f4e020a070e61b4ba8f7865ba127.mp4?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Warning</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risky Rocket is intended to be quite difficult, especially the main game.  Whilst the controls are easy to learn, they can be hard to master.\u00a0Persistence is key!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risky Rocket is a 3D Rocket Jumping platformer. Hone your skills and launch through the climb map and many time trial levels. Using the physics of momentum, and propulsion of rockets to build up speed and become a master of Rocket Jumping.<strong></strong><br><br>  <br><strong>Climb to the top</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend the skies using nothing but your feet and rocket launcher! Can you reach top? Be careful.. one wrong move may send you back down to the beginning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/17645b636744321ff8596d38da9fc0ed.poster.avif?t=1753051866\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/17645b636744321ff8596d38da9fc0ed.webm?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/17645b636744321ff8596d38da9fc0ed.mp4?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against players around the world in the Time Trial levels with online leaderboards. Maximize your speed-running abilities and achieve all the gold medal times! Perhaps there's something more lucrative than Gold..\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/44885620b58704c1edc1d5c25a454839.poster.avif?t=1753051866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/44885620b58704c1edc1d5c25a454839.webm?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/44885620b58704c1edc1d5c25a454839.mp4?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/3398f4e020a070e61b4ba8f7865ba127.poster.avif?t=1753051866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/3398f4e020a070e61b4ba8f7865ba127.webm?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905160/extras/3398f4e020a070e61b4ba8f7865ba127.mp4?t=1753051866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Warning</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risky Rocket is intended to be quite difficult, especially the main game.  Whilst the controls are easy to learn, they can be hard to master.\u00a0Persistence is key!</p>",
